  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 7302.10 Unallowable Costs. Any work that is not described in the PDA completed by FEMA shall be deemed unallowable costs for the purpose of this loan.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Saf-C 5900) #13168, 2-19-21",
